; Generated by scripts/generate-flt-quadratic-quotients.py; checked native terms.
; Two arbitrary polynomials represent the same quotient
; element exactly when their computed constant and linear remainders
; are equal. Trailing zeros and noncanonical coefficient representatives
; are handled by the proved coefficient relation.
